# AI harness

> **Status (2026-09-10):** local `hc-agent` and `~/.ai-harness` are installed; `airoute` is not on PATH.

Canonical AI project state lives in `.ai/`. Do not overwrite `.ai/ROUTING.md` or global `~/.ai-harness/config/` unless the user asked to change routing policy.

Before major implementation, read `.ai/STATE.json`, `.ai/REQUIREMENTS.md`, and `.ai/ROUTING.md`. HANDOFF and `.ai/history/` are retrieval-only and must not be loaded automatically.

Use the same roles as the router: Scout (Luna), Worker (Terra), Senior (Sol), Expert (Astra). Do not treat Astra as the default coding model.

When OpenAI delegation is useful, prefer `airoute` rather than inventing a parallel routing scheme.
